  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p class=\"hang\"><strong>Prerequisites</strong> Bone Knight Dedication</p><hr /><p>You raise the grim banner of Karrnath, commanding supreme discipline among your ranks. You project a 30-foot commanding aura. Undead allies and living comrades who follow your lead within the emanation gain a +1 status bonus to attack rolls and a +2 status bonus to saving throws against emotion and fear effects.</p><p>In addition, when an undead ally within your aura would be destroyed by taking damage (reduced to 0 Hit Points), it attempts a DC 15 flat check. On a success, it remains at 1 Hit Point instead.</p>"
    },
